A simple realistic close-up video in one continuous shot. One smooth gray stone falls naturally from above, enters the center of the water in a calm shallow pond, and makes contact. The contact produces a visible brief splash followed by circular ripples spreading across the water. A soft reflected highlight moves slowly from left to right across the water and receiver throughout the shot. The viewpoint, receiver, and background geometry remain stable. | one smooth gray stone | source enters water, then splash and expanding ripples
